   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Intergrating Capacity and Community Advancement Organisation</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Aims at improving youth health in Tanzania&#x2019;s Mara Region by reducing alcohol harm by 5% and strengthening community resilience. ICCAO mobilises communities, strengthens youth-led CSOs, works with local government authorities (LGAs), health workers and leaders, and advocates for alcohol by-laws. Activities include peer education, sports programmes and entrepreneurship training with starter kits across 16 wards.</narrative>
